OL,3,GNEWSA'Not giving birth in a car park is
OL,4,Aa good job'
OL,5,
OL,6,F"If we had waited, we probably would
OL,7,Fhave had to have our baby in a car
OL,8,Fpark."
OL,10,FJenny, who lives at Parracombe on the
OL,11,FDevon side of Exmoor, gave birth at a
OL,12,Fhospital more than one hour away after
OL,13,Fthe closure of her closest maternity
OL,14,Funit.
OL,23,APub: 26-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,347,340,200,160,0,100
