OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F346A1787748977
OL,1,W5j 5Q555pjsjjj js17kjc15 js57kj#4
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q--% (.*.. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,!
OL,3,GNEWSA'Not giving birth in a car park is
OL,4,Aa good job'
OL,5,
OL,6,FShe said she would have gone to North
OL,7,FDevon Devon District Hospital (NDDH) in
OL,8,FBarnstaple but, due to the Royal Devon
OL,9,FUniversity Healthcare NHS Foundation
OL,10,FTrust suspending maternity services
OL,11,Ffrom 11 August, she had to travel 51
OL,12,Fmiles (80km) away to a hospital in
OL,13,FExeter.
OL,15,FThe mother-of-three said her waters
OL,16,Fbroke in the early hours of 19 August,
OL,17,Fthe day she was due to be induced.
OL,23,APub: 26-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
